            {'after': 3, 'q': 'Why did Hatim slaughter his only mare?', 'options': ['He had no other way to feed his guest, since he had no food that night', 'The mare was sick and about to die anyway', 'He wanted a reward from the king', 'The messenger demanded it'], 'correct': 0},
